WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[Wind over the valley. Engines in the distance.]

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:08.000
[Engine hum and treads rattling close by.]

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:12.000
[Engine rumble carries across the ridge.]

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:17.300
[The engine sounds muffled through the scope.]

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.300
[Cannon cracks. A low boom rolls away.]

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
[Gunfire echoes across the valley.]

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:29.500
[Engine and tracks grind uphill. Guns trade shots.]

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.000
[Loud report from the turret.]

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:39.500
[Shots and impacts echo from the hillside.]

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:44.800
[Cannon blast, followed by a distant impact.]

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.000
[A sharp knock and a heavy thud. The engine dies away.]

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:56.000
[Fire crackles in the wind.]

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:59.900
[The other tank’s engine returns, then fades.]
